OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit to remain shut over
OL,4,Astaffing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening date of a north Devon
OL,7,Fmaternity unit has been delayed again
OL,8,Fbecause of an onoging shortage of
OL,9,Fstaff.
OL,11,FThe Royal Devon NHS Trust said it had
OL,12,Fappealed for help from the wider NHS
OL,13,Fand was searching internationally for
OL,14,Fstaff so it could reopen the unit for
OL,15,Fbirthing services at the North Devon
OL,16,FDistrict Hospital at Barnstaple safely.
OL,18,FThe unit has been shut since August and
OL,19,Fthe closure jas meant expectant parents
OL,20,Ffrom parts of rural Devon and also
OL,21,Fnorth east Cornwall having to travel to
OL,22,Fthe Royal Devon and Exeter Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
