OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit to remain shut over
OL,4,Astaffing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it took the decision
OL,7,Fafter its latest readiness assessment,
OL,8,Fbut added it remained "committed to
OL,9,Freopening birthing services... as soon
OL,10,Fas possible."
